      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think we should put the wait for settle here before the write and at the end of the ISR (after process_timers)\n\nThis ensure that we don\u0027t write to a settling status bit (the very first time) nor do we call the ISR a second time while the status bit was settling.\n\nBoth waits should be a single reading in almost every scenario.\n\n(I don\u0027t think we should wait on settling right after the write as we can let that happen in parallel with the process_timers call)",
